AIHawk includes or adapts work from these projects.

src/aihawk/profile.py, src/aihawk/database.py
  The search plan's rules and the rarity weight follow the planner of the author's earlier job-search engine; the credit is to that work.

The published job database
  Is merged from the public sources named in pipeline/build.py, each with its home and licence as far as
  it states one; each release's manifest.json lists them, with the rows each gave or the error that left
  it out that day, and every row names the sources that carried it. Each posting belongs to its employer and links back to the original.
  docs/data-sources.md lists each source with its licence and how to ask for its removal. AIHawk's MIT licence
  covers its code, not this data. Job data from Headcount Labs (https://headcountlabs.com), ODbL 1.0, with location
  data from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL) and Overture Maps. Forward Deployed Engineer jobs from FDE Times, CC BY 4.0.
